OL,3,GNEWSAShop owner tells of raid as
OL,4,Abalaclava ban enforced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lone pregnant woman whose shop was
OL,7,Fraided by balaclava-clad teenagers has
OL,8,Fdescribed her ordeal as a ban on the
OL,9,Fface covering came into force in
OL,10,FNottingham city centre.
OL,12,FNottingham became one of the first
OL,13,Fcities to introduce the restrictions,
OL,14,Fwhich could see #70 on-the-spot fines,
OL,15,Fconfiscation of the face covering and
OL,16,Freferral to an immediate justice
OL,17,Fprogramme requiring community work.
