OL,3,GNEWSAShop owner tells of raid as
OL,4,Abalaclava ban enforced
OL,5,
OL,6,FHannah and Dan Byrne, who run Knit
OL,7,FNottingham in Trinity Walk, said four
OL,8,For five teenagers stole stock and
OL,9,Fruined a window display, before
OL,10,Freturning to stand outside in an act of
OL,11,F"intimidation" last June.
OL,13,FDan added he did not see how the new
OL,14,Fpowers would be enforced "when there's
OL,15,Fno police in town anyway".
